\subsection{A New Class of Biological Simulation Architecture}

OOBSE-v1.0 introduces a novel paradigm in biological computation by 
transforming ontology structures (NCBITaxon, Relations Ontology, OWL/RDF 
graphs) into sparse tensor representations embedded within hyperbolic 
manifolds. This enables executable, multiscale ecological and evolutionary 
simulation directly from semantic knowledge bases. No prior system has 
combined ontology science, hyperbolic geometry, and Hamiltonian dynamics 
into a unified simulation engine.

