post-quantum secure biological computation framework. This represents a 
historically significant fusion of cryptographic resilience and 
high-performance biological simulation, ensuring long-term security 
against quantum adversaries.

\subsection{Symplectic Stability Across Billion-Step Trajectories}

The symplectic Störmer-Verlet kernel demonstrates long-term Hamiltonian 
